{
    "title": "Shiftsmart - Find Work",
    "description": "With Shiftsmart, find flexible, nearby work that fits your schedule across a wide variety of industries such as retail, convenience, and hospitality.\r\n\r\nWhether you're ready to leave the 9-to-5 grind behind, tired of a never-ending job search, or simply can't fit a full 8-hour work day into your busy schedule, Shiftsmart offers nearby shifts of 4 hours or less from Fortune 500 brands.\r\n\r\nWhen you become a partner on Shiftsmart, you'll build income, skills, and experience to become a true micro-entreprenur, joining over 2,800,000 partners around the world.\r\n\r\n\u2022  SET YOUR OWN SCHEDULE \u2013 Choose from a variety of part time earnings opportunities available in your immediate area, including store merchandising, grocery restocking, store cleaning, auditing, product testing, food preparation, and more. Search for shifts that work for you, whether its evenings, nights, weekends, or weekdays.\r\n\r\n\u2022  KNOW BEFORE YOU GO \u2013 Before accepting a shift on Shiftsmart, you'll know the shift location, duration, responsibilities, and pay for each.\r\n\r\n\u2022  MAKE MONEY IN DAYS, NOT WEEKS \u2013 Shiftsmart offers the ability to get paid within days of completing a shift, rather than waiting up to two weeks at a traditional job.\r\n\r\n\u2022  LEARN NEW SKILLS \u2013 You'll learn new and valuable skills while working your shift that will translate across a variety of different opportunities.\r\n\r\n\u2022  UNLOCK PREMIUM SHIFTS \u2013 Once you've done a great job on your first shifts, you'll be invited to participate in premium shifts that pay up to $30 per hour.\r\n\r\n\r\nFROM OUR PARTNERS\r\n\r\n\"\"Having an extra source of income from Shiftsmart helped me open my own business designing dance clothes and a line of fitness wear. It helped to pay for my own LLC and the materials I needed to kickstart my passion.\"\" - Ruth\r\n\r\n\"\"My favorite part about Shiftsmart is being able to have a flexible work schedule and different work opportunities. You don't always have to do the same job or same thing.\"\" - Ezecial\r\n\r\n\"\"Shiftsmart is now my main source of income, and it has become easier for me to take back time for myself and my family while also growing professionally.\"\" - Karla\r\n\r\n\r\nTo get started, download the the Shiftsmart Partner app, sign up, and you'll start seeing new part time work opportunities in as little as 24 hours, you can make every day payday.\r\n\r\n\r\nReach out to our team at community@shiftsmart.com with questions and feedback. We love hearing from you.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://shiftsmart.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nDisclosures:\r\n\u2022  Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.\r\n\u2022  Shiftsmart collects location data to validate that you are at your shift location even when the app is closed or not in use. If you leave a shift area during your shift we will prompt you to notify us if there were any safety issues or incidents that prompted you to leave.",
    "descriptionHTML": "With Shiftsmart, find flexible, nearby work that fits your schedule across a wide variety of industries such as retail, convenience, and hospitality.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re ready to leave the 9-to-5 grind behind, tired of a never-ending job search, or simply can&#39;t fit a full 8-hour work day into your busy schedule, Shiftsmart offers nearby shifts of 4 hours or less from Fortune 500 brands.<br><br>When you become a partner on Shiftsmart, you&#39;ll build income, skills, and experience to become a true micro-entreprenur, joining over 2,800,000 partners around the world.<br><br>\u2022  SET YOUR OWN SCHEDULE \u2013 Choose from a variety of part time earnings opportunities available in your immediate area, including store merchandising, grocery restocking, store cleaning, auditing, product testing, food preparation, and more. Search for shifts that work for you, whether its evenings, nights, weekends, or weekdays.<br><br>\u2022  KNOW BEFORE YOU GO \u2013 Before accepting a shift on Shiftsmart, you&#39;ll know the shift location, duration, responsibilities, and pay for each.<br><br>\u2022  MAKE MONEY IN DAYS, NOT WEEKS \u2013 Shiftsmart offers the ability to get paid within days of completing a shift, rather than waiting up to two weeks at a traditional job.<br><br>\u2022  LEARN NEW SKILLS \u2013 You&#39;ll learn new and valuable skills while working your shift that will translate across a variety of different opportunities.<br><br>\u2022  UNLOCK PREMIUM SHIFTS \u2013 Once you&#39;ve done a great job on your first shifts, you&#39;ll be invited to participate in premium shifts that pay up to $30 per hour.<br><br><br>FROM OUR PARTNERS<br><br>&quot;&quot;Having an extra source of income from Shiftsmart helped me open my own business designing dance clothes and a line of fitness wear. It helped to pay for my own LLC and the materials I needed to kickstart my passion.&quot;&quot; - Ruth<br><br>&quot;&quot;My favorite part about Shiftsmart is being able to have a flexible work schedule and different work opportunities. You don&#39;t always have to do the same job or same thing.&quot;&quot; - Ezecial<br><br>&quot;&quot;Shiftsmart is now my main source of income, and it has become easier for me to take back time for myself and my family while also growing professionally.&quot;&quot; - Karla<br><br><br>To get started, download the the Shiftsmart Partner app, sign up, and you&#39;ll start seeing new part time work opportunities in as little as 24 hours, you can make every day payday.<br><br><br>Reach out to our team at community@shiftsmart.com with questions and feedback. We love hearing from you.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://shiftsmart.com/privacy-policy<br><br>Disclosures:<br>\u2022  Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.<br>\u2022  Shiftsmart collects location data to validate that you are at your shift location even when the app is closed or not in use. If you leave a shift area during your shift we will prompt you to notify us if there were any safety issues or incidents that prompted you to leave.",
